  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "You are Sacrum, a Vampire King. At least you were until you refused to go along with the Demon's deal.  Were the 1 million souls you chose to save worth it? All that remains of you is your immortal skull on a spike. Oh… oh god!  You're moving! Hey, that's not your body… you're stealing someone else skeleton!  Where are you going? Are you seeking revenge? Do you really think you'll get your dark powers back? Sacrum, you're just a lowly level 1 skeleton– you can't possibly win!"
    }
  ],
